        "values": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Jhin's final round attack has an uncancellable windup, always critically strikes, including against structures, and deals bonus physical damage equal to 15 / 20 / 25 (based on level)% of the target's missing health. The damage based on the target's health is capped at 800 against monsters.",
